{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf6 Welcome to a\u00a0<strong>Merge + Roguelike + Idle Farming Management Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are thrown onto a lonely island.<br>The island is small.<br>The bills are <i>very</i> punctual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this island, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place chickens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place cows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant flowers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant fruit trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait for them to produce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And try to stay alive until the next bill arrives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/79c04b2ff691d7bf9a81bc30e9bd61c5.poster.avif?t=1772563762\" width=720 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/79c04b2ff691d7bf9a81bc30e9bd61c5.webm?t=1772563762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/79c04b2ff691d7bf9a81bc30e9bd61c5.mp4?t=1772563762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb8 The Bill System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every once in a while,<br>a bill will appear.<br>On time. Every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does <strong>not</strong> care about:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your layout looks good</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your farm feels cozy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your chicken has a name</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It only asks one question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have enough money?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No?<br><strong>Game over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very clean. Very fair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf89 Paying the Bill Is Not the End \u2014 It\u2019s Card Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to pay the bill,<br>the system rewards you with a choice:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A photo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, a photo.<br>Not gold.<br>Not equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These photos are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff-style cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stackable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capable of changing your entire run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently <strong>100+ cards</strong>,<br>and yes \u2014 the strategy gets a little deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/162f150f291b0f8f201c99901a342a52.poster.avif?t=1772563762\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/162f150f291b0f8f201c99901a342a52.webm?t=1772563762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/162f150f291b0f8f201c99901a342a52.mp4?t=1772563762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2764\ufe0f And Then You Get \u2665</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a run ends,<br>the system gives you one more thing:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2665</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn\u2019t make you richer.<br>It doesn\u2019t make you stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It lets you<br><strong>decorate and fill rooms.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udeaa What Happens in the Rooms Is Up to You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll use \u2665 to decorate and fill rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no bills here.<br>No timers.<br>No bankruptcy warnings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just memories,<br>waiting for you to place them properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh \u2014<br>and there\u2019s a small secret.<br>You\u2019ll know when you find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/131ae38896781b3fd62bb918d08288f9.poster.avif?t=1772563762\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/131ae38896781b3fd62bb918d08288f9.webm?t=1772563762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/131ae38896781b3fd62bb918d08288f9.mp4?t=1772563762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf5 Why Is Everything So Cute?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because everything is made in a<br><strong>felt / wool-crafted art style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickens are soft.<br>Tables are soft.<br>Even the toilet is soft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes. The toilet too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/b93fe881e5e001b487b0fee60e5daef5.avif?t=1772563762\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras_big/b93fe881e5e001b487b0fee60e5daef5.avif?t=1772563762 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd16 About Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One more thing:<br>Aside from gameplay, story, and animation,<br><strong>everything else was made entirely by AI.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd16 One Last Thing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s much more to discover in the game,<br>and we can\u2019t wait for you to try it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues,<br>or have thoughts, feedback, or complaints \u2014<br>please reach out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I genuinely mean it.<br>I would be <strong>very happy</strong> to hear them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for playing \u2764\ufe0f</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069000?t=1772563762","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069000?t=1772563762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/550c29e31c22dbb56455dad992de41b4c8012a83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772563762","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/550c29e31c22dbb56455dad992de41b4c8012a83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772563762","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4074310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf6 Welcome to a\u00a0<strong>Merge + Roguelike + Idle Farming Management Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are thrown onto a lonely island.<br>The island is small.<br>The bills are <i>very</i> punctual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this island, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place chickens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place cows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant flowers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant fruit trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait for them to produce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And try to stay alive until the next bill arrives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/79c04b2ff691d7bf9a81bc30e9bd61c5.poster.avif?t=1772563762\" width=720 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/79c04b2ff691d7bf9a81bc30e9bd61c5.webm?t=1772563762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/79c04b2ff691d7bf9a81bc30e9bd61c5.mp4?t=1772563762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb8 The Bill System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every once in a while,<br>a bill will appear.<br>On time. Every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does <strong>not</strong> care about:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your layout looks good</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your farm feels cozy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your chicken has a name</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It only asks one question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have enough money?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No?<br><strong>Game over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very clean. Very fair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf89 Paying the Bill Is Not the End \u2014 It\u2019s Card Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to pay the bill,<br>the system rewards you with a choice:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A photo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, a photo.<br>Not gold.<br>Not equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These photos are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff-style cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stackable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capable of changing your entire run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently <strong>100+ cards</strong>,<br>and yes \u2014 the strategy gets a little deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/162f150f291b0f8f201c99901a342a52.poster.avif?t=1772563762\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/162f150f291b0f8f201c99901a342a52.webm?t=1772563762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/162f150f291b0f8f201c99901a342a52.mp4?t=1772563762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2764\ufe0f And Then You Get \u2665</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a run ends,<br>the system gives you one more thing:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2665</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn\u2019t make you richer.<br>It doesn\u2019t make you stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It lets you<br><strong>decorate and fill rooms.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udeaa What Happens in the Rooms Is Up to You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll use \u2665 to decorate and fill rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no bills here.<br>No timers.<br>No bankruptcy warnings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just memories,<br>waiting for you to place them properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh \u2014<br>and there\u2019s a small secret.<br>You\u2019ll know when you find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/131ae38896781b3fd62bb918d08288f9.poster.avif?t=1772563762\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/131ae38896781b3fd62bb918d08288f9.webm?t=1772563762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/131ae38896781b3fd62bb918d08288f9.mp4?t=1772563762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf5 Why Is Everything So Cute?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because everything is made in a<br><strong>felt / wool-crafted art style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickens are soft.<br>Tables are soft.<br>Even the toilet is soft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes. The toilet too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras/b93fe881e5e001b487b0fee60e5daef5.avif?t=1772563762\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069000/extras_big/b93fe881e5e001b487b0fee60e5daef5.avif?t=1772563762 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd16 About Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One more thing:<br>Aside from gameplay, story, and animation,<br><strong>everything else was made entirely by AI.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd16 One Last Thing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s much more to discover in the game,<br>and we can\u2019t wait for you to try it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues,<br>or have thoughts, feedback, or complaints \u2014<br>please reach out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I genuinely mean it.<br>I would be <strong>very happy</strong> to hear them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for playing \u2764\ufe0f</p>","developers":["LIU JIEYI"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"